<title>USA: ASARCO's Glover workers in new labor deal.</title>
<headline>ASARCO's Glover workers in new labor deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workers at ASARCO's Glover lead facility in Missouri have accepted a new three-year labor deal, a spokesman for the company said.</p>
<p>The new contract is effective from April 1. The previous three-year deal expired March 31.</p>
<p>In 1996, Glover produced 243,300 short tons of refined lead.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
